    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are thrilled to present to the open market this three bedroomed family home, in the heart of Castlemartyr. This home is located in the quiet and private Bridgetown estate.\n \nThe ground floor comprises a living room with a solid fuel stove, W/C, and a kitchen/dining area. On the first floor there are 3 bedrooms and a family bathroom. \n\nExternally, there is an exceptionally large, corner garden which is not overlooked from the rear, complete with a patio area.\n \nThe location is superb in terms of convenience being within a moments stroll to Castlemartyr main street and all amenities it has to offer. It also enjoys easy access to the N25 and yet only five minutes' drive from the Garryvoe beach whilst also being close to Fota Wildlife Park, Ballymaloe, Midleton, Cork City and a whole range of top attractions.\n \nEarly viewings come highly recommended, as this will be sure to attract a wide market!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.95m x 5.05m\nTiled\n\nLiving Room - 4.58m x 3.32m\nLaminate Flooring, Open Fireplace\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.37m x 3.50m\nTiled\n\nW/C - 1.75m x 1.33m\nTiled\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.18m x 2.12m\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.00m x 2.68m\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.45m x 2.68m\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.60m x 2.60m\nCarpeted\n\nBathroom - 2.60m x 1.95m\nTiled, Bath/Shower\n\nStorage - 1.00m x 1.00m\nHot Press\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Walking distance to all local amenities</li><li>3 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom</li><li>C1 BER</li><li>Built in 2003</li><li>90 Square Meters</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>Mains Services</li><li>PVC Double Glaze Windows</li><li>Outdoor Tap</li><li>High Speed Fiber Broadband</li><li>Large Private Rear Garden</ul>"
